Z||000004||flyntus||03-25-2001||12:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mbramble:<BR><B>What I was hoping is that someone has one of the 'boxes' from Chris West or Archie who could provide the measurements.  Someone used to have a diagram that showed al the measurements but I just can't seem to find it anywhere....</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Mbramble,<BR>Go to Chris West's site at <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com," TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com,</A> <BR>click on "Ultimate upgrade then click on Battery box installation procedures.  There <BR>are some battery box measurements there. Hope this helps.   flyntus<P>||||reg||1
