Z||000012||batboy||03-25-2001||06:59 PM||||Hey Bro! Got the upstairs vacuumed, think I'll continue to ignore the basement for a while longer. Filled up a vacuum bag full of cat hair and boxelder bugs. Yes, I've been fighting an insect infestion, but looks like I've just about won. Had to exile the kitties and do some spraying. Country living...gotta love it. Boxelders are better than cockroaches though. Most my new car parts that are in the house are scattered throughout the spare bedroom and the basement utility room. Hehehe, I even have a 4 bolt main short block (slated for the Batmobile) in the basement too.<P><BR>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/batkid3.gif">     <B>BATBOY</B><BR>1985 SE auto with 350 Chevy V8 (Batmobile),<BR>suspension mods, lowered, GA brakes, battery<BR>relocated up front, stereo mods, etc...<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 03-25-2001).]||||reg||1
